All 88 initiative detail pages were statically generated at build time via [generateStaticParams](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/src/app/initiatives/%5Bslug%5D/page.tsx#25-28). Zero TypeScript errors.

## Key Design Decisions

1. **Static data over database** — Initiatives stored in TypeScript rather than Supabase to avoid migration complexity and enable static generation
2. **Hardcoded defaults with DB override** — About page professional data is hardcoded but can be overridden if DB `content_pages` has data
3. **Color-coded criticality** — Critical (red), High (amber), Medium (blue), Low (gray) for visual scanning
4. **Multi-filter system** — Year, Program, Criticality, and text search all combinable
